         "link": null,
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "html",
           "html": "<p><strong>Booking challenge: </strong>the old site didn’t guide users to a clear action; too many choices and scattered messages made scheduling (call/WhatsApp/form) hard.</p><p><strong> Visual challenge:</strong> uninspiring, cluttered layout, inconsistent type/colors, confusing price tables without vehicle‑type segmentation (sedan/SUV/pick‑up), missing social proof (reviews/before‑after), and weak hierarchy of headings/benefits.</p><p><strong>Mobile challenge: </strong>low CTA visibility, uneven load times, and scroll friction. Goal: offer clarity, 1–2‑step booking flow, mobile‑first, and an aesthetic that signals trust &amp; quality.</p>",
           "keepLast": false,
           "classes": [
            "font_size_desktop_1em",
            "font_size_tablet_1em",
