           "html": "<p>Simple layout, clear hierarchy, primary CTA, vehicle‑type tables (sedan/SUV/pick‑up), photos &amp; videos (before/after), testimonials, sticky mobile CTA, short form, WhatsApp/call, transparent copy (in/out), brands/products, WebP/AVIF + lazy load, AA accessibility, local SEO (schema, NAP, map).</p>",
