          {
           "type": "list",
           "icon": "dot",
           "spacing": "15px",
           "html": "<ul><li><strong>Simple layout redesign</strong> with clear hierarchy and primary CTA.</li><li><strong>Vehicle‑type price tables</strong> (sedan/SUV/pick‑up) and in/out scope descriptions.</li><li><strong>Visual sections</strong> with photos &amp; videos (before/after) + testimonials and trust badges.</li><li><strong>Sticky mobile CTA</strong> and short form (name, location, vehicle type, service).</li><li><strong>WhatsApp/call integration</strong> with click/event tracking.</li><li><strong>Local on‑page SEO</strong>: headings/titles/meta, Local Schema, NAP, embedded map.</li><li><strong>Performance</strong>: LiteSpeed, WebP/AVIF images, lazy load, CLS/LCP control.</li><li><strong>AA accessibility</strong>: contrast, ALT, focus, roles.</li><li><strong>Simplified copy</strong> and confidence‑building microcopy.</li><li><strong>Analytics</strong>: <strong>GA4</strong> + <strong>Google Search Console</strong> (contact/booking events).</li></ul>"
          },
